TI  - Evaluation of the TEOM(R) method for measurement of ambient particulate mass in urban areas
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AIR & WASTE MANAGEMENT ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - AIR-POLLUTION
KW  - MORTALITY
KW  - IMPACTOR
