TI  - Laboratory and field evaluation of crystallized DOW 704 oil on the performance of the well impactor ninety-six fine particulate matter fractionator
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AIR & WASTE MANAGEMENT ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - IMPACTION SURFACES
KW  - DESIGN
